WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.636
Start with the fictional planning need and the earlier project record.

00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:10.536
The small-business owner needs a clear way to organize weekly priorities and task owners.

00:00:10.536 --> 00:00:17.700
The case supplies a provider who can prepare a reviewed template, instructions, one example and a checklist.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.807
No audience test is supplied.

00:00:19.807 --> 00:00:21.071
Keep that limit.

00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:27.393
Do not ask AI to invent buyer interviews or call a predicted preference observed evidence.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:34.136
For an internal service, identify the team member and service expectation instead of inventing a sale.

00:00:34.136 --> 00:00:38.772
Carry open access, review and permission dependencies from the adoption plan.

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:44.672
Write a short brief with the person, situation, need, useful result and evidence gap.

00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:49.729
The draft offer can remain provisional while an audience test is pending.

00:00:49.729 --> 00:00:53.943
This continues the same project; it does not restart discovery.
